@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Get current project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/project

### Set project path
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/project
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "C:/path/to/your/repo"
}

### Get project config
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/project/config

### Get library items (personas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/library/personas

### Get library items (standards)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/library/standards

### Get library items (concepts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/library/concepts

### Get library items (design)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/library/design

### Get drafts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spec/drafts

### Get issues
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spec/issues

### Get single issue details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/spec/issues/42

### Start spec session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/spec/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "draftId": null,
  "type": "feature"
}

### Send message in spec session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/spec/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "abc123",
  "content": "I want to add dark mode support"
}

### Get active runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/run

### Start a run
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/run/42

### Get run logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/run/abc123/logs

### Abort a run
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/run/abc123

### Get history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/history
